          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "1. **Ex 1 — Value mappings** (~5 min): turn a number into BAU / Warning / Critical\n2. **Ex 2 — Thresholds & cell coloring** (~5 min): one value, two presentations\n3. **Ex 3 — Data links** (~10 min): click a service, then land on its detail dashboard\n\n**How to edit a panel:** hover the 🛠 panel → press **e** (or ⋮ → *Edit*). The options search box at the top right of the editor is your friend: type *mapping*, *threshold*, or *link*.\n\nCompare your result with the ✅ panel. If you need to start over, discard your changes.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.3.0-36978054224",
      "targets": [],
      "title": "Lab agenda",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
