      "options": {
        "content": "1. Edit **🛠 Your turn — services without links**\n2. **Add field override** → *Fields with name* = `Service` → **Data links** → *Add link*\n3. Title: `View service logs →`\n4. URL (type `$` to open the variable picker):\n   `/d/jemz7s9/service-detail-e28094-logs?var-service=${__data.fields.Service}&${__url_time_range}`\n5. Leave *Open in new tab* off for in-app drill-downs; turn it on for external tools\n6. Save the panel and click **Auth**. The detail dashboard opens with Auth and the same time range already selected\n\n**Bonus:** add `Open runbook →` with `https://runbooks.example.com/${__data.fields.Service}`, or a ServiceNow search link",
